+review={'timeUTC':datetime.datetime.now(datetime.timezone.utc).isoformat(),'sourceHash':mf['sourceHash'],'auditedWindowRows':256,'auditedLongRows':64,'UNKNOWN':0,'projectionEventAudit':'all per-event work/absoluteWork/impulse/P/L sums and peak net velocity jump agree with cumulative ledgers within recorded rounding tolerance','groups':{},'chaosInsufficient':dict(gates),'limits':['Observed-active FRAME fraction is not physical pulse-duration duty cycle. Finite acceleration undefined without a pulse duration.','Planet external impulse is the sum of absolute changes of momentum MAGNITUDE; it is not the full vector-jump impulse and can underestimate it. Existing signed/absolute energy and deltaP/deltaL ledgers are separate. Do not relabel this quantity as complete P5 impulse.','Energy residual is yearly sampled, not a continuous bound or proof of long-term statistics convergence.','RSS is endpoint process RSS, not a measured process-wide peak; wall time includes checkpoint activity and shared-CPU execution.','Formal source/configuration frozen; post-hoc cost review does not change the preregistered outcomes.']}
